  "body": "Enjoy the very best of coastal living in this beautifully elevated new build at Lot 62, 22 Pakirikiri Street, Long Bay. Positioned at the top of Long Bay, this property offers unparalleled access to the vibrant Long Bay Village, renowned for its cafes, bars, eateries, and more.\r\n\r\nThis modern 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home, complete with a single-car garage, is situated on one of the last remaining plots in this sought-after development. Designed by a reputable 10-Year Master Builder, it promises quality, style, and peace of mind with a comprehensive structural and workmanship guarantee of up to 10 years.\r\n\r\nWith top-rated Long Bay College and Long Bay Beach just a stroll away, this home combines luxury and convenience in a prime coastal setting.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out - contact Dean or Jamie today to learn more!",
